@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@payerToken = REPLACE_WITH_PAYER_BEARER_TOKEN
@providerToken = REPLACE_WITH_PROVIDER_OWNER_BEARER_TOKEN
@approverToken = REPLACE_WITH_FIRST_INDEPENDENT_PLATFORM_OPERATOR_TOKEN
@verifierToken = REPLACE_WITH_SECOND_INDEPENDENT_PLATFORM_OPERATOR_TOKEN
@operatorPassword = REPLACE_LOCALLY_DO_NOT_COMMIT_A_REAL_PASSWORD
@ownerOrg = REPLACE_UUID
@providerOrg = REPLACE_UUID
@propertyId = REPLACE_UUID
@workId = REPLACE_UUID
@accountId = REPLACE_UUID
@claimId = REPLACE_UUID
@receiptId = REPLACE_UUID
@destinationId = REPLACE_UUID
@payoutId = REPLACE_UUID
@workVersion = 0
@version = 1
@account = {{base}}/api/v1/service-payments/{{accountId}}
@admin = {{base}}/api/v1/admin/service-finance/accounts/{{accountId}}

### Open owner-funded maintenance account after accepting the current quote.
# For a personal booking use POST /api/v1/me/work-requests/{{workId}}/payments with its tenant token.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrg}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/work-requests/{{workId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{payerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","workVersion":{{workVersion}}}

### Current service statement: reload its version before each different command.
GET {{account}}
Authorization: Bearer {{payerToken}}

### Payer reports an external payment. Reporting is not receipt verification.
POST {{account}}/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{payerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{version}},"amount":"1500.00","channel":"BANK_TRANSFER","reference":"REPLACE_WITH_CHECKED_EXTERNAL_REFERENCE","receivedOn":"2026-10-15","reason":"Transfer reported for the agreed service quote."}

### Review incoming claims (payer/operator only).
GET {{account}}/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}

### Operator verifies the receiving statement independently before this request.
# Use /reject with the same shape when the claim cannot be verified.
POST {{admin}}/claims/{{claimId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{version}},"password":"{{operatorPassword}}","reason":"Confirmed matching funds on the authorized receiving statement."}

### Alternative: record a direct independently verified receipt, not an additional copy of the claim payment.
POST {{admin}}/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{version}},"amount":"1500.00","channel":"BANK_TRANSFER","reference":"REPLACE_WITH_ANOTHER_EXTERNAL_REFERENCE","receivedOn":"2026-10-15","password":"{{operatorPassword}}","reason":"Matched an actual external collection on the receiving statement."}

### Provider registers an already provisioned external opaque beneficiary identifier.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/organizations/{{providerOrg}}/provider-payouts/destinations
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","channel":"BANK_TRANSFER","beneficiaryToken":"beneficiary_REPLACE_WITH_EXTERNAL_OPAQUE_ID","maskedLabel":"Business Bank ****1234","currency":"KES"}

### Independent operator records completed external beneficiary ownership checks.
# Use REVOKED to suspend this destination immediately; do not overwrite it.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/admin/service-finance/destinations/{{destinationId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","status":"VERIFIED","password":"{{operatorPassword}}","reason":"Verified the external beneficiary identity, ownership and settlement currency."}

### Provider requests payout only after completion, cleared funding and strictly more than 14 days.
POST {{account}}/payouts
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{version}},"destinationId":"{{destinationId}}","reason":"Reviewed the gross quote, frozen fee and net provider entitlement."}

### Operator payout queue.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/admin/service-finance/payouts?status=REQUESTED&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}

### Operator approves the frozen instruction; this does not initiate a transfer.
POST {{admin}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{version}},"password":"{{operatorPassword}}","reason":"Reviewed completed service, cleared funding and verified beneficiary."}

### Second independent operator records a verified completed external payout.
# amount must equal providerEntitlement from the statement (default zero fee: 1500.00).
# Date must be on/after release eligibility and funding and not in the future.
POST {{admin}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/paid
Authorization: Bearer {{verifierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{version}},"amount":"1500.00","channel":"BANK_TRANSFER","reference":"REPLACE_WITH_VERIFIED_PAYOUT_REFERENCE","receivedOn":"2026-10-30","password":"{{operatorPassword}}","reason":"Verified the completed external transfer to the approved beneficiary."}

### Payout failure/cancellation after approval is allowed only after confirming no transfer succeeded.
# /reject applies to REQUESTED; /cancel or /fail applies to APPROVED.
POST {{admin}}/payouts/{{payoutId}}/fail
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{version}},"password":"{{operatorPassword}}","reason":"External reconciliation confirmed that no funds were transferred."}

### Record an externally completed refund; cannot spend reserved/paid principal or earned fee.
POST {{admin}}/receipts/{{receiptId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{verifierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{version}},"amount":"100.00","channel":"BANK_TRANSFER","reference":"REPLACE_WITH_VERIFIED_REFUND_REFERENCE","receivedOn":"2026-10-15","password":"{{operatorPassword}}","reason":"Verified the completed refund against this source receipt."}

### Void an unused receipt correction. A void does not send a refund.
POST {{admin}}/receipts/{{receiptId}}/void
Authorization: Bearer {{verifierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{version}},"password":"{{operatorPassword}}","reason":"Correcting a mistakenly entered receipt after external reconciliation."}

### Close only after reports are resolved, all net funds refunded and payouts withdrawn.
POST {{account}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{payerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$guid}}","version":{{version}},"reason":"Financial records reconciled before ending this assignment."}

### Provider currency-separated financial dashboard.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/organizations/{{providerOrg}}/provider-payouts/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Provider payout request history.
GET {{base}}/api/v1/organizations/{{providerOrg}}/provider-payouts/requests?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Safe service financial history.
GET {{account}}/history?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{payerToken}}
